lidhandler (1.3.1) noble; urgency=low

  * Fix critical lid-switch ignore bug: set HandleLidSwitchExternalPower and
    HandleLidSwitchDocked in addition to HandleLidSwitch. Without these,
    lid-ignore fails on AC power and docked/multi-monitor setups.
  * Replace non-POSIX 'local' keyword in daemon_pid() with POSIX-compliant
    variable for pure sh compatibility.
  * Refactor DEBIAN/postinst to call lidhandler enable instead of duplicating
    drop-in content.
  * Closes #21.

 -- Aditya An1l <aditya.anil.productions@gmail.com>  Tue, 21 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000

